  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INTEGRATED HUMAN RIGHTS PROMOTION</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Vicariate of Solidarity has been working since the 1980s in area of Sicuani, south western Peru, to protect, defend, and promote the human rights of the local community. During the civil war (1980-2000) this involved denouncing violations while today they support local communities to recognise, understand, participate politically and pressure for the government to be accountable and to provide them with basic services. In a context of high levels of impunity for human rights violations the Vicariate also works to demand reparations for the victims of political violence. Now the partner focuses on working with communities affected by mining and large scale mega projects to defend their land rights and environment.</narrative>
  </description>
